p.src:
The decision test is therefore: $\hbox{continue pursuing outside capital only if}
\qquad
V_{\mathrm{process}} > 0 .$ In the story, the firm passed, and the founders were relieved. The pass was not their choice in the narrow procedural sense. But the lesson was theirs: the company still had growth, profit, and focus, while the fundraising process had become frustrating.

